            | -                           e edit                Open in editor
            | -                           : prompt              Open the prompt
            | -                           o options             Open the options menu
            | -                    <Ctrl-L> screen-redraw       Redraw the screen
            | -                           z stop-loading        Stop all loading views
            | -                           v show-version        Show version information
